---
import "./styles/styles.css"
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Cami Layé Okún – About</title>
      <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>

  </head>

  <body class="page-about">

    <nav class="top-nav">
      <div class="nav-container">
        <a href="/" class="logo">CAMI LAYÉ OKÚN</a>
        <ul class="nav-links">

          <li><a href="/about" class="active">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tour">Tour</a></li>
          <li><a href="/playlist">Playlists</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="about-main">
      <section class="about-hero">
        <h1>About Cami Layé Okún</h1>
        <p class="about-tagline">
          Cuban DJ, selector and radio host digging deep into Afro‑Cuban,
          Caribbean and Latin American sounds.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-content">
        <div class="about-text">
          <p>
            Cami Layé Okún is a Cuba‑born DJ and vinyl selector known for
            building warm, dance‑floor journeys from rare Afro‑Cuban records,
            Caribbean gems and soulful disco.
          </p>
          <p>
            Her sets are storytelling sessions, where each track is a piece of
            a larger musical map connecting Havana, the Caribbean, Latin
            America and the African diaspora.
          </p>
          <p>
            Alongside touring internationally, she hosts
            <strong>“Insolar”</strong>, a regular radio show where she shares
            sunny, groove‑driven selections and highlights music scenes that are
            often under‑represented.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-highlights">
          <h2>Highlights</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>100% vinyl DJ sets with a focus on deep digging</li>
            <li>Regular radio host curating global sunny sounds</li>
            <li>Sets moving from spiritual jazz to tropical disco and beyond</li>
            <li>Known for intimate, storytelling‑driven performances</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>


    <footer>
      <div class="social-links">
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/camilayeokun/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Instagram</a>

        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/camilayeokun/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Facebook</a>
        
        <a href="https://www.nts.live/shows/cami-laye-okun"target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">NTS Radio</a>
        
        <a href="https://soundcloud.com/camila-garc-a-valent-n" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">SoundCloud</a>

      </div>

      <div>
        <p>&copy; 2025 Cami Layé Okún. All Rights Reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
